item.p:
fulfilment service provider means any natural person or legal entity that, in the course of a business activity, offers any two of the following services: warehousing, packaging, addressing and shipping of products, without being the owner of such products; not included are postal services under Article 2 letter a of the Postal Services Act of 17 December 2010

  SR 783.0
	 and any other services involving the movement of goods;

radio equipment in accordance with Article 2 paragraph 1 letter a of the Ordinance of 25 November 2015
SR 784.101.2 on Telecommunications Installations
Name in accordance with Art. 43 para. 1 let. d of the O of 25 Nov. 2015 on Telecommunications Installations, in force since 13 June 2016 (AS 2016 179). used by radio amateurs, with the exception of the installations made available on the market;

be accredited in accordance with the Accreditation and Designation Ordinance of 17 June 1996

 SR 946.512
	;
